Tests bridging performance, backpressure handling, and end‑to‑end data flow between native code and React Native JS under tight latency constraints.

## Key Concepts
- TurboModules/JSI integration for low‑overhead bridges
- Native worker thread + ring buffer for streaming data
- On‑device compression (e.g., LZ4) and batch sizing
- ReadableStream‑like JS API with start/pause/resume and flush control
- Memory budgeting and lifecycle cleanup

